  "category": "Punching Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "While apparently doing nothing, it fires punches in lightning fast volleys that are impossible to see.",
      "version": "red"
    },
    {
      "text": "While apparently doing nothing, it fires punches in lightning fast volleys that are impossible to see.",
      "version": "blue"
    },
    {
      "text": "Punches in corkscrew fashion. It can punch its way through a concrete wall in the same way as a drill.",
      "version": "yellow"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its punches slice the air. However, it seems to need a short break after fighting for three minutes.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its punches slice the air. They are launched at such high speed, even a slight graze could cause a burn.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "To increase the strength of all its punch moves, it spins its arms just before making contact.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
    {
      "text": "HITMONCHAN is said to possess the spirit of a boxer who had been working towards a world championship. This POKéMON has an indomitable spirit and will never give up in the face of adversity.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
